SUMMARY:Idaho: Form 65 (partnership) / 41S (S-corp) due
DESCRIPTION:Idaho partnership return due the 15th day of the 4th month afte
 r year-end - a real outlier from the more common 3rd-month pattern (consist
 ent with Idaho's estimated-tax outlier status already noted elsewhere in th
 is data set). | Idaho partnership return due the 15th day of the 4th month 
 after year-end - a real outlier from the more common 3rd-month pattern (con
 sistent with Idaho's estimated-tax outlier status already noted elsewhere i
 n this data set). A valid extension (payment-based\, via prepayment) allows
  filing up to 6 months late. | Authority: Idaho State Tax Commission\, dire
 ct fetch this session: "on or before the 15th day of the fourth month follo
 wing the close of your tax year" and "you can file your return up to six mo
 nths late with a valid extension." | Source: https://tax.idaho.gov/taxes/in
